msgctxt "80"
msgid "Hey, what are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Oh, hey! You're that guy from Kamurocho! I remember you! Do you recognize "
"us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "...How could I not? I see you're still together, somehow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Of course we are! Don't tell me you want to get between me and my amazing "
"Mizuki-chan!? Sorry, but this angel is mine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Actually, I just want to make sure you're not going to try to kill yourself "
"again. I have enough to deal with without you lovebirds getting into "
"trouble in front of my orphanage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Me, kill myself? Why would I do that? Mizuki-chan and I have always had a "
"wonderfully close relationship!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Right, Mizuki-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Oh, Akimoto-kun! You're gonna make me blush..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Where'd you get the money to go on vacation in Okinawa, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"It's part of the loan I took out for our wedding! Though we haven't "
"officially tied the knot yet. We're just engaged."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Engaged!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "That's right. Akimoto-kun is my fiancé now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Huh. Good for you, I guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"You'll still need to leave, though. I hate to break it to you, but this "
"beach isn't open to the public."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"Not to mention the fact that it's not even beach season. Go frolick "
"somewhere else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "What gives? It's not like this beach belongs to you or anything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "This \"frolicking\" is going to make a great story to tell our kids someday!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"That's right. We've made so many wonderful memories here! Right, "
"Akimoto-kun?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "We sure have, Mizuki-chan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Hey, Akimoto-kun... I'm getting kinda hungry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Okay, then let's go to the <Color:7>Public Market<Color:Default> to eat!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Yeah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "You think they'll be okay, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "As long as they keep their heads low... But I wouldn't count on that."
msgstr ""

